{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "來", "id": "來"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "同", "id": "同"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "氣", "id": "氣"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "羞", "id": "羞"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "辭", "id": "辭"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "政", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.252762968495368, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.4795730802618863, "source": "政", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "政", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.3364722366212129, "source": "政", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.9391619220655967, "source": "同", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.1474024528375417, "source": "同", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.6026896854443837, "source": "同", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 0.7419373447293773, "source": "羞", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.6174060820832772, "source": "羞", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 3.2268439945173775, "source": "羞", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "羞", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 2.1972245773362196, "source": "羞", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.3705460041517514, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 